<title>IRAQ: Iraq says expects to resume oil exports mid-August.</title>
<headline>Iraq says expects to resume oil exports mid-August.</headline>
<dateline>BAGHDAD 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iraq expects to resume oil exports under its oil-for-food deal with the United Nations in mid-August, Iraq's Oil Minister Amir Muhammed Rasheed said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;In our minds we are expecting to resume oil exports at the middle of August,&quot; Rasheed said at a press conference for Western reporters in Baghdad.</p>
</text>
